],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","overview":"Dante, autista di scuolabus per bimbi down, non sa di essere sosia di Johnny Stecchino, mafioso pentito barricato in casa per paura di essere ucciso. Dante conosce la donna di Stecchino e, innamorato, la segue in Sicilia dove rischia la morte.","tagline":"Non me somijia pe' niente!"},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Good hearted but not very wordly-wise, Dante is happy driving the school bus for a group of mentally handicapped children, while feeling he is somehow missing out on life and love. So he is very excited when after nearly being knocked down by her car he meets Maria, who seems immediately enamoured of him. He is soon invited to her sumptuous Palermo villa, little suspecting that this is part of a plot. He bears an amazing likeness to Maria's stool-pigeon gangster husband and it would be convenient for them if the mobster, in the shape of Dante, was seen to be dead and buried.","tagline":"Sometimes a banana is just a banana!"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/otry4EnqhiBRr23j1M1tBNR8GS8.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/otry4EnqhiBRr23j1M1tBNR8GS8.png","language":"it","width":975,"height":503}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/im7KfvlvYf8Grlemc9lOMqgt4cG.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/im7KfvlvYf8Grlemc9lOMqgt4cG.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1200},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1GDJhMBHyKCP9AjtO1xOC7clxqE.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1GDJhMBHyKCP9AjtO1xOC7clxqE.jpg","language":"it","width":1125,"height":1688},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hGdSOE2RH4vJ23K4SJl2ru4eKgN.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hGdSOE2RH4vJ23K4SJl2ru4eKgN.jpg","language":"it","width":1414,"height":2121},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/origina